Tandem-DETR

This repository is built on D-FINE (https://github.com/Peterande/D-FINE),
Copyright (c) 2024 The D-FINE Authors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
D-FINE in turn builds on RT-DETR (https://github.com/lyuwenyu/RT-DETR),
Copyright (c) 2023 lyuwenyu, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

Tandem-DETR adds the stem-output backbone, tandem encoder and fusion block,
VisDrone configurations and conversion, data augmentations, and release tools.
Configuration loading, decoder anchor batching, training, visualization,
inference and ONNX export have also been adapted. Upstream copyright notices
are retained in the source.
